          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “The people of Gaza have sinned again and again, and for this I will certainly punish them. They carried off a whole nation and sold them as slaves to the people of Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I will send fire upon the city walls of Gaza and burn down its fortresses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will remove the rulers of the cities of Ashdod and Ashkelon. I will punish the city of Ekron, and all the Philistines who are left will die.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.8",
