            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “The people of Tyre have sinned again and again, and for this I will certainly punish them. They carried off a whole nation into exile in the land of Edom, and did not keep the treaty of friendship they had made. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
